      "name": "Question 2",
      "problem": "What are the terms of the expression $2d-9e+5f+11?$",
      "worked_solution": "We put an addition symbol $(+)$ between each part and separate using parentheses:\n\n$$\n(2d)+(-9e)+(5f)+(11)\n$$\n\n \n\nSo, the expression has four terms:  $2d$, $-9e$, $5f$, and $11.$",
