      "name": "Question 4",
      "problem": "What are the individual terms of the expression $p-2q+3r?$",
      "worked_solution": "We put an addition symbol $(+)$ between each part and separate using parentheses:\n\n$$\n(p)+(-2q)+(3r)\n$$\n\n \n\nSo, the expression has three terms:  $p$, $-2q$, and $3r.$",
