      "name": "Question 5",
      "problem": "What are the terms of the expression $7k-5l?$",
      "worked_solution": "We put an addition symbol $(+)$ between each part and separate using parentheses:\n\n$$\n(7k)+(-5l)\n$$\n\nSo, the expression has two terms:  $7k$ and $-5l.$",
