    "q-176829": {
      "dom_id": "step-q176829",
      "name": "Question 6",
      "problem": "The fourth term of the expression $7u-2v-0.3w+10x$ is{{field-1}}.",
      "worked_solution": "We put an addition symbol $(+)$ between each part and separate using parentheses:\n\n$$\n(7u)+(-2v)+(-0.3w)+(10x)\n$$\n\nCounting off the terms:\n\n- the first term is $7u,$\n\n- the second term is $-2v,$\n\n- the third term is $-0.3w,$ and\n\n- the fourth term is $10x.$\n\nIn particular, we are interested in the fourth term. The fourth term is $10x.$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
