    "q-67054": {
      "dom_id": "step-q67054",
      "name": "Question 13",
      "problem": "Which of the following is equivalent to the expression $-2p+3q-5r?$",
      "worked_solution": "The expression $-2p+3q-5r$ has three terms:  $-2p$, $3q$, and $-5r.$ \n\nThe order in which we combine the terms doesn't matter. Therefore, we can also write this expression as \n\n$$\n3q-5r-2p.\n$$",
